                  "description": "Data modification window; \n\nreturns teams added or updated within the last N days, e.g. 1 or 2."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "cmd",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Extended data flag; set to more to include team introductions and honors."
