        {
          "id": "5f3a22ff-c45d-4745-816e-d21ff771a2cb",
          "name": "Player Profile / Teamlist with Player Profile",
          "request": {
            "name": "Player Profile / Teamlist with Player Profile",
            "description": {
              "content": "**Player Profile** (teamId=82)\n\n• This API endpoint returns comprehensive profile and identity data for football players, supporting records for both club and national team associations.\n\n\n\n• Requests require at least one parameter from teamId, day, or playerId (these three parameters are mutually exclusive and cannot be used simultaneously).\n\n\n\n• Use it after calling the <a href=\"https://www.isportsapi.com/en/docs.html?id=246\" style=\"color:blue\">Teamlist with Player Profile</a> endpoint to obtain valid teamIds, then use those IDs here to retrieve the complete player profiles for each squad.\n\n\n\n• It is recommended to perform an initial full data synchronization followed by regular incremental updates, using the unique recordId to distinguish between multiple team associations for the same player.\n\n**Teamlist with Player Profile** (cmd=teamlist)\n\n• This API endpoint returns a comprehensive list of all team IDs that have associated player profile data in the database.\n\n\n\n• It provides a flat array of unique identifiers representing every team with an active roster.\n\n\n\n• Use it as the primary entry point to obtain valid teamId values, which are required for retrieving detailed squad information via the Player Profile endpoint.\n\nMust add one of the two parameters teamId and playerId.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "sport",
                "football",
                "player"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "teamId",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Get player data for a specified team.　Supports up to 50 IDs."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "playerId",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Get specified player data."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "day",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Data modification window;\n\nreturns players updated within the last N days."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "cmd",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Extended data flag; \n\nset to more to include player honors."
                }
              ],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": null
