            "name": "League & Cup Profile",
            "description": {
              "content": "• This API endpoint returns profile data for leagues and cups, including name, logo, current season, and competition structure. By default, returns all available leagues and cups.\n\n\n\n• Use the leagueId parameter to retrieve a specific competition, or day to fetch recently modified records.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
